  "body": "## Summary\n- `just console` starts farmd, Portal, and `worker-loop.sh` when farmd/runner/gitd/verifier/`transaction_offline` exist.\n- `--leave-bootstrap` writes a cookie-free ops session so the worker can claim; missing gitd is `worker=UNBOUND`.\n- Runbook and dogfood README name no-args `bullet` as the TUI and drop the stale \u201cno producer / credentials never reach the child\u201d lines.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `bash -n` on `operator-console.sh` and `serve.sh`\n- [ ] Hosted lint (includes `operator-console-test.sh` admission refusals)\n- [ ] Hosted fast / docs / required SUCCESS\n- [ ] After merge: `gh run list --workflow CI --branch main` latest required SUCCESS\n\nHOLD stays. No tokens. No `live_admission=true`.\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
